lua51-rs -- a drop-in Lua 5.1 library (C API) on top of rilua
===============================================================================

Copyright (c) 2026 DaragonTech Unipessoal Lda

This project (the C API layer in src/, csrc/lapi_fmt.c, the build scripts,
the lua51.dll proxy, the tracer in tools/, the tests and benchmarks, and the
patches to rilua in RILUA_PATCHES.diff) is licensed under either of

  * the MIT License, reproduced below, or
  * the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE, or
    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)

at your option -- the same terms as rilua, on which it is built.

Unless you explicitly state otherwise, any contribution intentionally
submitted for inclusion in this work by you, as defined in the Apache-2.0
license, shall be dual licensed as above, without any additional terms or
conditions.


